.TH QUIPU-PATH 1 "" quipu "Quipu Manual"
.SH NAME
quipu\-path \- Golden\-path analysis: provenance cone, backtest and draft
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBquipu path\fR [\fB\-\-db\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Golden\-path analysis: provenance cone, backtest and draft
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-db\fR \fI<PATH>\fR
Store file (default: .bobbin/quipu/quipu.db; configuration may override it)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
quipu\-path\-cone(1)
Compute the provenance cone of a trajectory
.TP
quipu\-path\-backtest(1)
Backtest a pruned trajectory over recorded history
.TP
quipu\-path\-draft(1)
Draft a golden\-path policy from a trajectory as Turtle for review
.TP
quipu\-path\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
